# Elesh Norn, Mother of Machines makes "Name Sticker" Goblin's enters ability trigger twice, and each triggering is its
# own ability, checking its intervening "if it's on the battlefield" again as it resolves (CR 603.2d, 603.4). The first
# resolves and rolls a 1: {R}{R}{R}{R}. With the second still on the stack Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Goblin from that
# mana; the second then finds the Goblin gone and rolls nothing, so three red are left in the pool, not seven.

